{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Let's evaluate the two sigma expressions and see which of them results in $4 + 5 + 8 + 13$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=1}^4(3-m)^2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=(3-(1))^2+(3-(2))^2+(3-(3))^2+(3-(4))^2\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4 + 1 + 0 + 1\n\\end{align}$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=0}^3\\left(m^2+5m+4\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\left[(0)^2 \\!+\\! 5(0) \\!+\\! 4\\right] \\!+\\! \\left[(1)^2 \\!+\\! 5(1) \\!+\\! 4\\right] \\!+\\! \\left[(2)^2 \\!+\\! 5(2) \\!+\\! 4\\right] \\!+\\! \\left[(3)^2 \\!+\\! 5(3) \\!+\\! 4\\right]\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4 + 10 + 18 + 28\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, neither sigma expression is equal to $4 + 5 + 8 + 13$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Consider the sum $4 + 5 + 8 + 13$.\n\n**Which expression is equal to the above sum?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=1}^4(3-m)^2$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\displaystyle\\sum_{m=0}^3\\left(m^2+5m+4\\right)$","correct":false},{"content":"","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
